WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.979 --> 00:00:05.480
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and since we’ve
only got a couple more episodes left in Walking

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.400
Dead this season I thought it was time to
do some more predictions.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.740
So here’s 10 things I think will or in some
cases will not happen.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.033
If you’re finding me for the first time
I’m also doing a weekly giveaway in all

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:16.930
my Walking Dead review videos just to say
thanks for be so awesome.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:21.320
All you have to do to enter is be a subscriber
and leave a comment.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.630
The next round starts Sunday.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.999
So let’s predict some awful things.

00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:29.640
Careful for spoilers if you’re not caught
up on Season 4 yet.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:30.640
But here we go.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:35.149
Number 10 - Lizzie and Mika are the new Billy
and Ben from the comics.

00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:38.860
So based on what’s happening on the show
right now, around this time in the comics

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:41.820
two little twin boys appeared named Billy
and Ben.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:45.520
Ben started torturing and killing animals
just like Lizzie has been doing.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:48.280
Ultimately Ben in the comics kills his brother
Billy.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:52.309
He’s completely nuts, and based on the way
Lizzie has been behaving since the season

00:00:52.309 --> 00:00:54.350
came back, especially with baby Judith.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:58.770
It seems like she and Mika are taking the
place of the brothers in the comics.

00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:02.629
In the teaser for episode 14 you can see the
Mika on the ground with Walkers coming after

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:03.859
her and Carol crying.

00:01:03.859 --> 00:01:07.370
It implies that Mika will get bitten.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.870
Based on Billy and Ben’s story line that
would suggest that Lizzie will then kill Mika

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.690
to prevent her from turning.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:16.310
So yes she’s murdering her sister, but she
was infected so it wouldn’t be quite as

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:17.890
bad as it was in the comics.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:21.190
The show does that a lot, where they change
things from the comics so that they’re still

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:23.430
really bad, but not quite as graphic.

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:25.734
So essentially Lizzie will end up killing
Mika or it’s also possible that she’ll

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:28.410
try to kill her and Tyreese and Carol will
stop her.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:32.900
Ben’s plot in the comics involves Carl so
they’ll have to change it a little no matter

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:33.900
what.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.830
Number 9 - Maggie and Glenn are reunited

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:41.560
A lot of you were asking if Glenn was geographically
behind Maggie in the last episode.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:45.970
Based on the amount of time the show dedicated
to showing her insane finger painting scene

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:47.390
I think he is.

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.750
At the very least, they’ll meet up at Terminus
in the finale.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:54.940
It’s hard to guess where everyone is chronologically
just because the episodes jump around in time.

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:58.550
For instance, remember the person in Joe’s
gang that Daryl ran into.

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:02.600
He’s the same guy that ended up on the floor
in front of Rick.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:05.680
So what’s been happening as we jump from
group to group is that they’re telling the

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.760
story of everyone during the same period of
time.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:12.040
Most of them have been on foot the whole time
too, so they haven’t gone too far from the

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.040
prison.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.670
Forgetting for a sec about what happens in
the comics to their characters, I think they

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:18.030
will at least get a moment of reunion.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.090
Just the relief of having found each other.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:24.209
Inevitably something awful will probably happen
to them after that though.

00:02:24.209 --> 00:02:26.890
Number 8 - All of the groups will meet at
Terminus.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:31.930
I talked a little about this in my last Q&amp;A
video but there have been so many visual references

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:34.140
to the Terminus for all of the groups.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:36.569
It would be crazy if they didn’t all end
up there.

00:02:36.569 --> 00:02:40.400
Glenn is the furthest away, just because they
spent a couple hours on the road to Washington

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:43.939
DC, but we saw him staring at a Terminus map
last week.

00:02:43.939 --> 00:02:48.650
There’s this really cool old Anton Chekov
quote saying that a gun must never be placed

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:50.900
on stage if it’s never going to go off.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:55.239
It’s about the narrative of a story, meaning
don’t make promises you don’t intend to

00:02:55.239 --> 00:02:56.239
keep.

00:02:56.239 --> 00:03:00.010
And showing Glenn with the Terminus map is
kind of like a promise that he’s going there.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:03.720
The only real question is when he’ll finally
meet Maggie, either in the finale or right

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:04.720
before the finale.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:07.620
We don’t have any info on the plot of episode
15 yet.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:12.069
Number 7 - Daryl’s Group won’t be the
Hunters or The Saviors

00:03:12.069 --> 00:03:15.810
Right now they’re being referred to as the
Marauders, who appeared a long time ago in

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:16.999
the comics.

00:03:16.999 --> 00:03:21.299
But because Joe’s group is a lot bigger
than the Mauraders they’re a lot closer

00:03:21.299 --> 00:03:22.299
to The Hunters.

00:03:22.299 --> 00:03:27.230
The problem with calling them the Hunters
is 1, we haven’t seen them eat anyone yet.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.329
And Two, they’re very disorganized and chaotic.

00:03:30.329 --> 00:03:34.489
Please refer back to jerkoff’s strangling
each other while Rick hid under the bed.

00:03:34.489 --> 00:03:38.330
The other option is the Saviors, but the reason
I don’t think they’re the Saviors is because

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:40.909
that group is heavily tied to Negan and the
Sanctuary.

00:03:40.909 --> 00:03:44.689
Which, based on everything Robert Kirkman
has said, is a Season 5 thing.

00:03:44.689 --> 00:03:49.599
If they’re not Hunters, Mauraders or Saviors,
they’re just a new group the show created.

00:03:49.599 --> 00:03:52.290
I do think that they’re attached to the
Terminus though.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.180
They’re not just a random group of bandits.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:59.010
Number 6 - Terminus will be a version of The
Hilltop Colony

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:03.549
The Hilltop colony is a place Rick and the
survivors go before the Alexandria Safe Zone

00:04:03.549 --> 00:04:05.209
and before The Sanctuary.

00:04:05.209 --> 00:04:09.249
Additionally, it has one specific character
that I’ll talk about in a sec.

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:13.180
Hilltop Colony as a story point sets up a
lot of the things we know are coming, like

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.569
Negan and Alexandria.

00:04:14.569 --> 00:04:19.530
And it provides a place for a villain that’s
not a really huge character like the Governor

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:20.530
or Negan.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.290
Robert Kirkman said the whole reason in not
doing Negan right away was to give the story

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:27.890
time to breathe between those two characters
who are currently the two most epic villains

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:31.600
in the comic books.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:35.260
Number 5 - There won’t be any Negan, but
the new character Gareth will be a version

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:36.540
of Jesus

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:40.320
Jesus is the antagonist at Hilltop Colony
that I just mentioned.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.910
His real name is Paul Monroe and early on
he’s not really as much of a villain as

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.820
a character no one trusts.

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:50.200
He’s a really good fighter, so if Gareth
is the Jesus character we will probably get

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:54.720
to see him fight Abraham and Michonne like
in the comic book.

00:04:54.720 --> 00:05:00.190
Jesus lets all the other survivors know about
the existence of Negan and The Saviors.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.890
Mostly that they’re awful.

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:06.060
But the Hilltop and Jesus are the precursor
to Alexandra.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:09.500
And the name of Episode 16, the finale is
“A”.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.730
So it makes sense that this is how the story
will progress.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:16.030
Number 4 - Gareth took Beth to Terminus

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:19.920
Because there was a cross on the back of the
car and the whole house looked like a trap,

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.640
everyone thought The Hunters or The Saviors
might be involved.

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:26.240
But I think the cross could also be a visual
reference to the Jesus character.

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.280
Who is a little shady, but well meaning.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:31.930
That would mean that Gareth did take Beth,
but only to help her.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:35.780
Which still doesn’t answer the question
as to the House trap or why someone would

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.550
have led the Walkers to the house.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:42.160
It’s possible that the Gareth character
is a combination of Jesus from the Hilltop

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.360
Colony and the Gabriel character.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:48.680
Gabriel’s story did involve the Hunters
and Dale getting captured, it happens in the

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.030
comics before Hilltop colony too.

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:54.030
So the show could just be mashing a lot of
things together.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.940
Number 3 - Everyone will learn about Negan

00:05:56.940 --> 00:06:01.160
Negan is the leader of the Saviors, a really
sinister group that extorts money and does

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:06.650
terrible things to people in exchange for
protection from the Walkers.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:11.380
By all accounts he won’t be on the show
in a big way at least until Season 5.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.410
Everyone learns about him while they’re
at Hilltop Colony.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:15.140
Where Negan gets a lot of his supplies.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:20.970
His story crosses over to the Alexandra Safe
Zone, so if the finale is going to tease Alexandria,

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:23.770
it will also have to tease Negan.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:28.940
All of this also involves a lot of Carl, which
means Chandler Riggs will potentially have

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:31.260
a much more interesting story next season.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:32.840
Which I think is great.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:38.240
I think of Negan as being the most evil version
of Rick, which means there’s a real potential

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:42.830
for mirroring Carl’s relationship with Rick.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:51.740
Number 2 - Everyone will learn about the Alexandria
Safe Zone.

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:55.580
Alexandria Safe Zone is like the next Prison
location.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.930
A big walled area where everyone is safe from
Walkers.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:02.901
The name of the finale is “A” and that
seems like the biggest teaser you could possibly

00:07:02.901 --> 00:07:04.650
do for Alexandria.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:07.970
A lot of that story is tied up with Negan
and the Saviors, so I don’t think anyone

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:10.270
will get there until season 5.

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:14.110
A lot of people thought the radio message
Daryl heard was from there, but really I think

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:16.270
that was just from Terminus.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:21.850
Number 1 - There will be two more major deaths,
not just one.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:26.110
Remember how Lizzie is basically turning into
or is already the Ben character.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.380
Meaning she’ll either try to kill Mika or
will get killed herself.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.220
Either way I think it means one of the girls
is going to die.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.400
My other prediction is a little complicated.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:40.260
There was a rumor that a character that’s
still alive in the comics is going to die

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:41.380
on the show.

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:43.150
Which really narrows it down.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:46.180
Most of the people that are dead in the comics
are already dead on the show.

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:50.800
And there are a few characters on the show
that aren’t in the comics, so we have to

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:51.890
exclude them.

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:54.380
Meaning Daryl and Beth probably won’t die.

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:57.780
My earlier prediction last year was that it
would be Maggie.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:01.110
Depending on whether or not the show is going
to bring out The Hunters I may have to revise

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:03.720
this, but for now I’m sticking with her.

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:05.990
So let me know, who do you think is going
to die.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:09.870
And do you think Lizzie will try to kill Mika
or baby Judith.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:14.020
The teaser for the next episode really does
make it seem like someone is going to die

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:15.120
from the look on Carol’s face.

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.752
Like I said, new giveaway round begins on
Sunday in my review video, be sure to subscribe

00:08:19.752 --> 00:08:22.150
to get it.

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.620
Only three more episodes to go.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:28.730
Right now click here for my last walking dead
video and click here for the rest of my predictions

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.300
from last year.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:31.900
Some of them have already come true.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.339
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:08:34.339 --> 00:08:34.709
High Fives!

